        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "c54267e1-d641-3737-8e79-09277e1c8623",
                "word": "triade",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "7dab87ff-ad35-41fd-9032-7b054023029c",
                        "entry_id": "c54267e1-d641-3737-8e79-09277e1c8623",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "triades"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1975479d-8dce-3fb1-9fcd-fcd293263dbf",
                        "entry_id": "c54267e1-d641-3737-8e79-09277e1c8623",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Ensemble composé de trois unités, ou trio. Les trois éléments regroupés peuvent être identiques, ou de même nature, ou être différenciés à partir d'un simple point commun."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c4cff593-64a3-4b96-9472-59362ff425c7",
                                "sense_id": "1975479d-8dce-3fb1-9fcd-fcd293263dbf",
                                "text": "Il y a des triades de divers genres ; une triade est formée par les trois vertus principales, une autre par les trois vices qui leur répondent, une autre par les trois plus anciens rois, une autre par le ciel, la terre et l’homme, etc."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c30a398f-5893-40e6-bd49-7e0e4b537023",
                                "sense_id": "1975479d-8dce-3fb1-9fcd-fcd293263dbf",
                                "text": "La Chine et l’Inde formaient bientôt avec l’Égypte une triade menaçante, un cauchemar complexe, aux angoisses variées."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fe745497-3a1b-45c6-91f3-0a37720871e6",
                                "sense_id": "1975479d-8dce-3fb1-9fcd-fcd293263dbf",
                                "text": "Lors de l’intoxication aiguë, la présentation classique initiale est la triade : céphalées, nausées, vomissements et sensations vertigineuses."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f7e6770f-c9d0-309b-be75-f4de76e2720c",
                        "entry_id": "c54267e1-d641-3737-8e79-09277e1c8623",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Séquence configurationnelle ou séquence constitutive comprenant trois unités configurationnelles."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Stéréochimie"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c2616699-3b54-3cfe-bfe2-db8e5e391632",
                        "entry_id": "c54267e1-d641-3737-8e79-09277e1c8623",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Association criminelle de la mafia chinoise."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Illégalité"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "86a98e1c-f561-45cd-b362-152d328d677e",
                                "sense_id": "c2616699-3b54-3cfe-bfe2-db8e5e391632",
                                "text": "Depuis quand les triades recrutent-elles des nègres?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b91dc5c2-7bd1-4333-99ea-69c4d4f018f2",
                                "sense_id": "c2616699-3b54-3cfe-bfe2-db8e5e391632",
                                "text": "Après la fondation du Mandchoukuo, Fu Ziheng, membre de l'ordre Tong du Gang Vert, prend le commandement de la 1ʳᵉ brigade de l'armée pronipponne stationnée à Fengtian. Dans les casernes de Fengtian, beaucoup d'officiers se rallient à lui et forment un groupe local du Gang Vert. Cette alliance entre triades et autorités d'occupation japonaises aura des conséquences décisives sur les évolutions criminelles des 10 années à venir."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4568b821-2e9b-38bc-bb35-4ad8bc832dad",
                        "entry_id": "c54267e1-d641-3737-8e79-09277e1c8623",
                        "glosses": [
                            "accord constitué de trois notes."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9531a1f1-79d5-3fb9-bebc-6d54f94215eb",
                        "entry_id": "c54267e1-d641-3737-8e79-09277e1c8623",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Accord parfait."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Jazz"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1c17df8d-3e04-4137-a104-b2c9221d462d",
                        "source_entry_id": "c54267e1-d641-3737-8e79-09277e1c8623",
                        "source_sense_description": "Groupe de trois éléments",
                        "target_lang_word": "Triade",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Triade",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3ef51c17-827e-347f-b480-27be43730e91",
                                        "entry_id": "5c07b676-9e34-3c65-b2ba-3059793fb3f2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "ein Ganzes, das aus drei Unterbereichen/Teileinheiten/Komponenten besteht"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e3a07424-6165-444d-9d18-92e946a398e0",
                                                "sense_id": "3ef51c17-827e-347f-b480-27be43730e91",
                                                "text": "Chemie: „Fast alle bekannten Elemente hat man zu solchen Triaden, wie man sie nennt, vereinigt.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "141f1639-f304-44d4-8e7b-30b1ea4af130",
                                                "sense_id": "3ef51c17-827e-347f-b480-27be43730e91",
                                                "text": "Verslehre: „Der Begriff stammt aus der Verslehre. Dort bezeichnet eine Triade eine Gruppe von drei Strophen. Besonders griechische Tragödien sind nach diesem Muster aufgebaut.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1dba4268-e747-409e-afa5-afc761e15263",
                                                "sense_id": "3ef51c17-827e-347f-b480-27be43730e91",
                                                "text": "Wirtschaft: „Diese Problemstellung gewinnt eine neue prägnante Zuspitzung gegen Ende der neunziger Jahre: durch den verschärften Wettbewerb der unterschiedlichen „Kapitalismen“ in der Triade, also in den USA, Japan und Westeuropa.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f3f07dbb-0746-47b5-8c44-5d6d4db21ed2",
                                                "sense_id": "3ef51c17-827e-347f-b480-27be43730e91",
                                                "text": "Religion: „Vermehrt trat sie nun in der Triade Isis-Serapis-Harpokrates auf.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Triade",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3364d672-23fd-343a-ba62-0e4e1759c647",
                                        "entry_id": "b419c853-d23e-30f4-abe0-8c8ae6559f2a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "chinesische Untergrundorganisation/ kriminelle Vereinigung"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3c55bc4b-b63c-4d81-867c-a275a9009284",
                                                "sense_id": "3364d672-23fd-343a-ba62-0e4e1759c647",
                                                "text": "„Die Chinesischen Triaden waren aus den antiken Geheimgesellschaften hervorgegangen, den religiösen Gruppierungen und öffentlichen Hetzern, die sich gegen den Kaiser aufgelehnt hatten.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9250faed-ab95-4acf-a47c-3dde93ba2d7b",
                        "source_entry_id": "c54267e1-d641-3737-8e79-09277e1c8623",
                        "source_sense_description": "Groupe de trois éléments",
                        "target_lang_word": "triad",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "triad",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cad90b3b-60f5-3d3a-98bf-8aac043d9b9b",
                                        "entry_id": "561b80b6-610a-3296-bc96-74f7cd2a1ece",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A grouping of three."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "169c0c9d-850c-40a6-8f86-3691c9d8a796",
                                                "sense_id": "cad90b3b-60f5-3d3a-98bf-8aac043d9b9b",
                                                "text": "Later artworks showed many animals and gods, some of which were clearly identified with heavenly body. They often included the symbolic triad of Sun, Moon, and Venus."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "69ce098d-5fb9-4e0a-8a3c-3c6a287bc59e",
                                                "sense_id": "cad90b3b-60f5-3d3a-98bf-8aac043d9b9b",
                                                "text": "There are, says the Irish triad, 'three fewnesses that are better than plenty: a fewness of fine words; a fewness of cows on grass; a fewness of good friends around good ale'. As an Ulsterman I would agree."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fa049bd8-6491-3bd6-937c-75e4c2a5739d",
                                        "entry_id": "561b80b6-610a-3296-bc96-74f7cd2a1ece",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A word of three syllables."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "938696ac-3866-4ad9-afed-d05e830a1dc4",
                                                "sense_id": "fa049bd8-6491-3bd6-937c-75e4c2a5739d",
                                                "text": "In his general deportment he was pompous and important, affecting a species of florid elocution, which often became ridiculous from his misarranging the triads and quaternions with which he loaded his sentences."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "64fecdbd-d063-3eb2-89c6-33ff187b2b4b",
                                        "entry_id": "561b80b6-610a-3296-bc96-74f7cd2a1ece",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A branch of a Chinese underground criminal society, mostly based in Hong Kong."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c56ca2e5-a058-4873-8670-b9ab5b968fd8",
                                                "sense_id": "64fecdbd-d063-3eb2-89c6-33ff187b2b4b",
                                                "text": "The point — and the symbolism — was that so long as the informer kept his mouth shut he was alive. Harry had seen the result of zjuk carried out by the Tapei Triad on a poor jerk they found in a back street of Tan-shui. They had used broad nail heads that didn’t make such big holes on their way in. When the paramedics came and pulled the brick off the dead man, the face came with it.",
                                                "translation": "Phantom",
                                                "english": "Phantom"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3c924b32-7d86-3eed-ab2d-0256562ac4be",
                                        "entry_id": "561b80b6-610a-3296-bc96-74f7cd2a1ece",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "On a CRT display, a group of three neighbouring phosphor dots, coloured green, red, and blue."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9a9aab02-1833-3568-85b1-71fd3475c996",
                                        "entry_id": "561b80b6-610a-3296-bc96-74f7cd2a1ece",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A chord consisting of a root tone, the tone two degrees higher, and the tone four degrees higher in a given scale OR any chord with three notes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
